WEBVTT

00:05:28.974 --> 00:05:31.365
that I won't be able
to do enough, Abuelita.

00:05:32.484 --> 00:05:36.299
For me, being 18 years old
and trying to save the world

00:05:36.323 --> 00:05:38.228
means being a climate activist.

00:05:38.617 --> 00:05:41.164
Before, maybe it meant
studying to be a doctor

00:05:41.188 --> 00:05:43.482
or a politician or a researcher.

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:46.997
But I can't wait to grow up
and become one of those things.

00:05:47.514 --> 00:05:49.345
The planet is suffering,

00:05:49.369 --> 00:05:51.861
and we don't have the luxury
of time anymore.

00:05:53.469 --> 00:05:57.204
Saving the world as a teenager
means being good with words,

00:05:57.228 --> 00:06:00.093
understanding the science
behind the climate crisis,